{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44544","headline":"诗三百三首 二四一 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二四一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常闻国大臣，朱紫簪缨禄。\n富贵百千般，贪荣不知辱。\n奴马满宅舍，金银盈帑屋。\n痴福暂时扶，埋头作地狱。\n忽死万事休，男女当头哭。\n不知有祸殃，前路何疾速。\n家破冷飕飕，食无一粒粟。\n冻饿苦凄凄，良由不觉触。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}